{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>'If you will, you can become all flame.'</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the Realms of Sapia and uncover the mysteries beneath the ice. Shape your adventurer by delving into ruinous depths and learning from the locals. Fall to ashes, or become myth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sapia is a gritty RPG built upon Slackjaw Games' tactical turn-based combat system with\u00a0deck-building elements and a grand fantasy setting. Dark Souls meets Slay the Spire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 10 minute demo will see you making an escape from the prison stronghold known as Tur Domhainn as it crumbles around you after a failed arcane experiment. Test your strategy against deadly foes and emerge from within the mountain into the icy wilderness of The For.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D Pixel Art Style</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Combat Abilities</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gritty Fantasy Setting</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toggling Click-To-Move vs Real-Time Movement</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customisable Equipment</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Audio (With a song from AJ Suede)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Currently still in early development -\u00a0</strong>this is a test of initial mechanics which will be greatly expanded upon in future releases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features in progress: Accessibility options, procedurally generating dungeons, NPC dialogue interactions, character creation, class-based character progression and much more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the discord to leave feedback and suggestions or interact with the developers.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4055310?t=1760041413","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055310/c8a87c893e28c0a95ea9d308b5a0aca7af1cb308/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760041413","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055310/59ff0edc3e1fd49c906d27c4a7b9c001e2c01bd8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760041413","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055310/59ff0edc3e1fd49c906d27c4a7b9c001e2c01bd8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760041413","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>'If you will, you can become all flame.'</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the Realms of Sapia and uncover the mysteries beneath the ice. Shape your adventurer by delving into ruinous depths and learning from the locals. Fall to ashes, or become myth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sapia is a gritty RPG built upon Slackjaw Games' tactical turn-based combat system with\u00a0deck-building elements and a grand fantasy setting. Dark Souls meets Slay the Spire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 10 minute demo will see you making an escape from the prison stronghold known as Tur Domhainn as it crumbles around you after a failed arcane experiment. Test your strategy against deadly foes and emerge from within the mountain into the icy wilderness of The For.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D Pixel Art Style</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Combat Abilities</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gritty Fantasy Setting</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toggling Click-To-Move vs Real-Time Movement</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customisable Equipment</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Audio (With a song from AJ Suede)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Currently still in early development -\u00a0</strong>this is a test of initial mechanics which will be greatly expanded upon in future releases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features in progress: Accessibility options, procedurally generating dungeons, NPC dialogue interactions, character creation, class-based character progression and much more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the discord to leave feedback and suggestions or interact with the developers.</p>","developers":["Slackjaw Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"4022790","name":"Sapia"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055310/58c9a921a2467940c2f4ab2bd9a8a473466